SUMMARY:Trail work: Phantom/Liberty Cyn - Malibu Creek State Park - Libert
 y Cyn
LOCATION:Santa Monica Mountains (Malibu Creek\, Point Mugu and other parks
 )
DESCRIPTION:Santa Monica Mountains Trails Council - Trail Work Days\nhttps
 ://smmtc.org/trailwork/\n\n\n\nTrail maintenance days most Saturdays and 
 some weekdays\, about 8 AM - 2 PM. Tools and training provided. Conservat
 ion service hours that can support the National Outdoor Award conservatio
 n segment\, PVSA and Eagle/rank service (check the award rules). Read the
 ir volunteer FAQ for youth age and supervision rules before bringing a gr
 oup. (Listed on the organizer's schedule - confirm on the provider's page
  before you go.)
URL:https://smmtc.org/trailwork/
END:VEVENT
